(5520010, 797461, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . I really like this.  But it makes me so sad to think of an elk in a zoo.   As much as I love my zoo -- and go all the time -- it still makes my heart break when I see certain animals having to live in captivity.  An elk just needs to be with a herd in a big field, doesn''t it.   But the picture is so cute and creative.</td>', 'Awwww. . . I really like this.  But it makes me so sad to think of an elk in a zoo.   As much as I love my zoo -- and go all the time -- it still makes my heart break when I see certain animals having to live in captivity.  An elk just needs to be with a herd in a big field, doesn''t it.   But the picture is so cute and creative.', '2009-06-08 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
