(5523779, 796835, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the reptile and the way the bokeh sets him off so nicely.  Good use of diagonal comp (though he could use just a tad more room at the bottom).  Text is a bit busy, but it''s a good sentiment!</td>', 'I like the reptile and the way the bokeh sets him off so nicely.  Good use of diagonal comp (though he could use just a tad more room at the bottom).  Text is a bit busy, but it''s a good sentiment!', '2009-06-11 09:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
