(5523781, 796464, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the kitty - very good detail - and good forethought to frame it to support the text.  Love the "it''s boring here without you" - very much fits the photograph and a good sentiment to promote the zoo!</td>', 'Great shot of the kitty - very good detail - and good forethought to frame it to support the text.  Love the "it''s boring here without you" - very much fits the photograph and a good sentiment to promote the zoo!', '2009-06-11 09:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
