(5523785, 796074, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent sentiment to match your photograph, and a very lovely photograph it is, too!</td>', 'Excellent sentiment to match your photograph, and a very lovely photograph it is, too!', '2009-06-11 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523787, 797509, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the fascination the cat has with whatever it sees.  Text is nicely placed and I like how the colors match those in the photograph.</td>', 'Great shot - love the fascination the cat has with whatever it sees.  Text is nicely placed and I like how the colors match those in the photograph.', '2009-06-11 09:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523788, 797447, 30982, '<td valign="top">How very sweet!!  Nice capture of these guys enjoying their day.</td>', 'How very sweet!!  Nice capture of these guys enjoying their day.', '2009-06-11 09:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523789, 797451, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle/perspective/framing of this - that bit of green behind is a nice touch, and good job bringing out the textures on this beautiful creature.  Looks like a reasonably young elephant, yes?</td>', 'I really like the angle/perspective/framing of this - that bit of green behind is a nice touch, and good job bringing out the textures on this beautiful creature.  Looks like a reasonably young elephant, yes?', '2009-06-11 09:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523790, 797394, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  He does indeed have the expression of a crusty New Yorker, doesn''t he?</td>', 'Heh!  He does indeed have the expression of a crusty New Yorker, doesn''t he?', '2009-06-11 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523791, 797153, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool text effect to match the spotted kitty!</td>', 'Cool text effect to match the spotted kitty!', '2009-06-11 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523792, 797265, 30982, '<td valign="top">I just wanna reach up and pet that nose!  Looks so soft!  Very inviting photograph.</td>', 'I just wanna reach up and pet that nose!  Looks so soft!  Very inviting photograph.', '2009-06-11 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523793, 797408, 30982, '<td valign="top">Couple of things I really like about this - the way the wavy grass kinda echos the stripes of the zebra, and the fact that you can tell from the background that this is a zoo.  The whole point is indeed to promote a zoo!  The red is a bit strong for the text, but appropriate for advertising.</td>', 'Couple of things I really like about this - the way the wavy grass kinda echos the stripes of the zebra, and the fact that you can tell from the background that this is a zoo.  The whole point is indeed to promote a zoo!  The red is a bit strong for the text, but appropriate for advertising.', '2009-06-11 09:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523795, 797512, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing!  Perhaps a bit lacking in technicals but totally makes up for that in content.  I love the gallery/patron bit here - very fun shot!</td>', 'Very intriguing!  Perhaps a bit lacking in technicals but totally makes up for that in content.  I love the gallery/patron bit here - very fun shot!', '2009-06-11 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523796, 797453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yikes!!  I don''t think I want to visit one of those guys.  But a very cool look at one and nice different approach to the challenge!</td>', 'Yikes!!  I don''t think I want to visit one of those guys.  But a very cool look at one and nice different approach to the challenge!', '2009-06-11 09:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523797, 797435, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of the fur framing (and lettering) and an adorable shot of the camel - wonderful detail and nice soft light.</td>', 'Very interesting use of the fur framing (and lettering) and an adorable shot of the camel - wonderful detail and nice soft light.', '2009-06-11 09:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523798, 797331, 30982, '<td valign="top">What''s not to love about a face like that!  Great shot of the critter, nice poster layout.</td>', 'What''s not to love about a face like that!  Great shot of the critter, nice poster layout.', '2009-06-11 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523802, 797222, 30861, '<td valign="top">Haha! Be a little more impressive if his jaws weren''t tied :-) Cute shot.</td>', 'Haha! Be a little more impressive if his jaws weren''t tied :-) Cute shot.', '2009-06-11 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523830, 796713, 81530, '<td valign="top">This is the first photo that comes up for me in voting, and I have to believe this is a ribbon winner. Awesome photo.</td>', 'This is the first photo that comes up for me in voting, and I have to believe this is a ribbon winner. Awesome photo.', '2009-06-11 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523852, 797452, 80904, '<td valign="top">LoL, that meerkat is a bit happy to see us.</td>', 'LoL, that meerkat is a bit happy to see us.', '2009-06-11 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523854, 797291, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL at the caption!  Neat old critter and the green really adds spice to this shot.  A bit too bright on the top of his head.</td>', 'LOL at the caption!  Neat old critter and the green really adds spice to this shot.  A bit too bright on the top of his head.', '2009-06-11 10:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523855, 797484, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good idea!  After all, some of the primary targets for zoo advertising are children and their parents.  Cute pose, and nice touch with the fingernails!</td>', 'Very good idea!  After all, some of the primary targets for zoo advertising are children and their parents.  Cute pose, and nice touch with the fingernails!', '2009-06-11 10:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523857, 795772, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color on black for maximum impact - nice touch with the matching color for the text and framing, too!</td>', 'Excellent use of color on black for maximum impact - nice touch with the matching color for the text and framing, too!', '2009-06-11 10:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523858, 797481, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and a very good message to go along with the shot!</td>', 'Very strong composition and a very good message to go along with the shot!', '2009-06-11 10:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523860, 796739, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great detail on this lovely pachyderm!  And the text goes very well with the activity pictured.  I like how he''s posing for you, too!</td>', 'Great detail on this lovely pachyderm!  And the text goes very well with the activity pictured.  I like how he''s posing for you, too!', '2009-06-11 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523864, 796507, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I like how the picture kinda contradicts the text.  The primate looks bored but the text says "new!".  Somehow that works.  Good use of the foreground bokeh to provide a "break" for the text, though some of the letters get a bit lost in the darker parts.</td>', 'Heh!  I like how the picture kinda contradicts the text.  The primate looks bored but the text says "new!".  Somehow that works.  Good use of the foreground bokeh to provide a "break" for the text, though some of the letters get a bit lost in the darker parts.', '2009-06-11 10:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523865, 797485, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of highish contrast to create almost a ballet of flamingos!</td>', 'Nice use of highish contrast to create almost a ballet of flamingos!', '2009-06-11 10:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523869, 797450, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit plain as far as the picture (though good detail in the duck) but an excellent text presentation.  One would almost expect to see a bit more context to show it''s a kid''s farm (ie kids) or at least a zoo-type environment and not a duck down by the park somewhere.</td>', 'A bit plain as far as the picture (though good detail in the duck) but an excellent text presentation.  One would almost expect to see a bit more context to show it''s a kid''s farm (ie kids) or at least a zoo-type environment and not a duck down by the park somewhere.', '2009-06-11 10:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523871, 797391, 30982, '<td valign="top">You captured a good pose here!  I like the striped background to show off the striped cat.  If you had the room to do so, a bit less foreground and a bit more at the top make make a good composition as well.</td>', 'You captured a good pose here!  I like the striped background to show off the striped cat.  If you had the room to do so, a bit less foreground and a bit more at the top make make a good composition as well.', '2009-06-11 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523875, 796647, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love that you caught them both in a yawn!  They look like reasonably young guys.  Almost want to pet them... but not quite.  :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Love that you caught them both in a yawn!  They look like reasonably young guys.  Almost want to pet them... but not quite.  :-)', '2009-06-11 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523888, 797221, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot of this guy and very good detail with all the fuzzy nose hairs!  I also like how the ear overlaps the frame at the top.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot of this guy and very good detail with all the fuzzy nose hairs!  I also like how the ear overlaps the frame at the top.', '2009-06-11 10:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523890, 797413, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an odd looking fellow this is - and a great choice for your poster, since kids really would find this guy fascinating!  I also very much like your choice of font for this.</td>', 'What an odd looking fellow this is - and a great choice for your poster, since kids really would find this guy fascinating!  I also very much like your choice of font for this.', '2009-06-11 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523891, 797276, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, reference to Finding Nemo.  And a lovely shot of this guy - he really does look as though he''s beckoning the viewer into the picture!</td>', 'Ah, reference to Finding Nemo.  And a lovely shot of this guy - he really does look as though he''s beckoning the viewer into the picture!', '2009-06-11 10:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523892, 797419, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice integration of the text into the photo, and cute shot of the primates!</td>', 'Nice integration of the text into the photo, and cute shot of the primates!', '2009-06-11 10:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523893, 797461, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the sentiment!  And it looks like the elk really enjoys this particular activity.</td>', 'LOL!  Love the sentiment!  And it looks like the elk really enjoys this particular activity.', '2009-06-11 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523894, 797397, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little one!!  I''m not a huge fan of selective desat, but it is very well done here.</td>', 'Cute little one!!  I''m not a huge fan of selective desat, but it is very well done here.', '2009-06-11 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523895, 796506, 30982, '<td valign="top">This indeed looks as though it''s an ad I''d see on a billboard or in a magazine.  Very well conceived and executed!</td>', 'This indeed looks as though it''s an ad I''d see on a billboard or in a magazine.  Very well conceived and executed!', '2009-06-11 11:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523916, 797113, 30982, '<td valign="top">So cute and apparently tiny!!  Adorable shot to use for a zoo ad!</td>', 'So cute and apparently tiny!!  Adorable shot to use for a zoo ad!', '2009-06-11 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523917, 797452, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!  Gotta love the pose, and the sentiment and the framing suit it very nicely.  Very good entry!</td>', 'LOL!!!!  Gotta love the pose, and the sentiment and the framing suit it very nicely.  Very good entry!', '2009-06-11 11:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523920, 797429, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the sense of connection you got here, both in the photograph and emphasized through the words.  For balance, you could crop a bit on the right if you wish.  I like the realness of this - a good capture.</td>', 'I really like the sense of connection you got here, both in the photograph and emphasized through the words.  For balance, you could crop a bit on the right if you wish.  I like the realness of this - a good capture.', '2009-06-11 11:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523922, 797283, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done poster!  Nice lazy shot of the beastie and good use of the space above.</td>', 'Very well done poster!  Nice lazy shot of the beastie and good use of the space above.', '2009-06-11 11:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523925, 797480, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks as though it''s more of a farm than a zoo, but I figure it meets the challenge well enough.</td>', 'Looks as though it''s more of a farm than a zoo, but I figure it meets the challenge well enough.', '2009-06-11 11:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523927, 797444, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, good textures!  Good sentiment though perhaps a tad wordy for some.</td>', 'Nice pose, good textures!  Good sentiment though perhaps a tad wordy for some.', '2009-06-11 11:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523930, 797506, 30982, '<td valign="top">Stunning eagle shot.  Really nice bright bokeh bits, and very good placement of the text with the bird looking in that direction.</td>', 'Stunning eagle shot.  Really nice bright bokeh bits, and very good placement of the text with the bird looking in that direction.', '2009-06-11 11:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523931, 796937, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Works for those who like snakes; not so much for those who don''t!  Nice balance of the text color with the snake color.</td>', 'Heh!  Works for those who like snakes; not so much for those who don''t!  Nice balance of the text color with the snake color.', '2009-06-11 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523938, 796208, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and I love the shades of gray!  Nice use of text to match the sentiment of the photo and I like the font.  My only criticism would be it appears every so slightly oversharpened.  Definitely could see this as a brochure cover, though.</td>', 'Excellent idea and I love the shades of gray!  Nice use of text to match the sentiment of the photo and I like the font.  My only criticism would be it appears every so slightly oversharpened.  Definitely could see this as a brochure cover, though.', '2009-06-11 11:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523940, 797402, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!  Just the right emphasis on the focus and the sentiment is lovely!</td>', 'Very sweet!  Just the right emphasis on the focus and the sentiment is lovely!', '2009-06-11 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5523944, 797275, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is one odd-looking fish!  Very good choice to use as a "draw" for the park.  I like the subtlety of the text as well.</td>', 'That is one odd-looking fish!  Very good choice to use as a "draw" for the park.  I like the subtlety of the text as well.', '2009-06-11 11:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
