(5526063, 797349, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2009-06-13 00:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526067, 797325, 4793, '<td valign="top">Is this a bad hair day? Nice capture</td>', 'Is this a bad hair day? Nice capture', '2009-06-13 00:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526069, 797113, 4793, '<td valign="top">What kind of animal? Nice capture</td>', 'What kind of animal? Nice capture', '2009-06-13 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526071, 797413, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute and up close capture</td>', 'Cute and up close capture', '2009-06-13 00:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526077, 797448, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice in B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice in B&W', '2009-06-13 00:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526128, 796507, 62187, '<td valign="top">The lettering is a little hard to read to me but your placement of it couldn''t have been more perfect! Excellent focus on the ''Tang'' too!</td>', 'The lettering is a little hard to read to me but your placement of it couldn''t have been more perfect! Excellent focus on the ''Tang'' too!', '2009-06-13 02:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526129, 797276, 62187, '<td valign="top">The Aquatic photos always look so bizarre to me. I''ve never had the chance to photograph in an aquarium so I''ll have to say...great work here!</td>', 'The Aquatic photos always look so bizarre to me. I''ve never had the chance to photograph in an aquarium so I''ll have to say...great work here!', '2009-06-13 02:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526130, 797430, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like ''Cats'' are the top of the pile this time around...at least in my voting. Can''t help with anything truly ''Helpful'' but can certainly offer a 10.</td>', 'Looks like ''Cats'' are the top of the pile this time around...at least in my voting. Can''t help with anything truly ''Helpful'' but can certainly offer a 10.', '2009-06-13 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526132, 797325, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope your self-admitted ''Farm'' statement isn''t hurting you. I''d have been less honest and just left it out. My lineage is Scottish so I guess I have a sweet spot for your flawless photo. Plus, it''s not a ''Cat''! 10</td>', 'I hope your self-admitted ''Farm'' statement isn''t hurting you. I''d have been less honest and just left it out. My lineage is Scottish so I guess I have a sweet spot for your flawless photo. Plus, it''s not a ''Cat''! 10', '2009-06-13 02:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526133, 797484, 62187, '<td valign="top">A nice turn of events. Cute!</td>', 'A nice turn of events. Cute!', '2009-06-13 02:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526134, 797221, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus seems strange to me but not in a bad way. Not to hip on the brown color in the frame but I do love how you''ve applied in within the photo - haven''t figured that one out yet.</td>', 'The focus seems strange to me but not in a bad way. Not to hip on the brown color in the frame but I do love how you''ve applied in within the photo - haven''t figured that one out yet.', '2009-06-13 02:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526136, 797447, 62187, '<td valign="top">A bit noisy here and there and a little bright - may just be my monitor.</td>', 'A bit noisy here and there and a little bright - may just be my monitor.', '2009-06-13 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526138, 796739, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Surprised I haven''t seen this edit more often. Maybe it''s going out of style. Anyway, looks good with this subject and nicely done.</td>', 'Hmmm. Surprised I haven''t seen this edit more often. Maybe it''s going out of style. Anyway, looks good with this subject and nicely done.', '2009-06-13 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526142, 797398, 62187, '<td valign="top">The contrast is excellent as well as your framing. Also, the lettering is nicely done.</td>', 'The contrast is excellent as well as your framing. Also, the lettering is nicely done.', '2009-06-13 02:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526144, 797405, 62187, '<td valign="top">George looks curious - to me. Very sharp but curious. :&gt;)</td>', 'George looks curious - to me. Very sharp but curious. :>)', '2009-06-13 02:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526145, 797485, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a strange play on shadow and light. Excellent contrast though!</td>', 'What a strange play on shadow and light. Excellent contrast though!', '2009-06-13 02:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526146, 797461, 62187, '<td valign="top">Don''t tell my friend - he drew an archery tag for an Elk this year! Nice to see some real humor in an entry!</td>', 'Don''t tell my friend - he drew an archery tag for an Elk this year! Nice to see some real humor in an entry!', '2009-06-13 02:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526147, 797506, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice, sharp focus.', '2009-06-13 02:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526148, 797482, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge and perspective on this shot.  You did catch the goat''s eyes well.  Personally I would not be attracted to this zoo ad.  There is too much text that is hard to interpret and not much of interest in the picture.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge and perspective on this shot.  You did catch the goat''s eyes well.  Personally I would not be attracted to this zoo ad.  There is too much text that is hard to interpret and not much of interest in the picture.', '2009-06-13 02:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526149, 796464, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and I''m guessing a nicer edit - especially on that background fence.</td>', 'Nice lighting and I''m guessing a nicer edit - especially on that background fence.', '2009-06-13 02:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526152, 797113, 62187, '<td valign="top">Whatever that thing is it''s WAY TOO CUTE! A Porcupine? Too funny for a ''Petting Zoo''! I hope this one beats the pants off all those vicious looking animals.</td>', 'Whatever that thing is it''s WAY TOO CUTE! A Porcupine? Too funny for a ''Petting Zoo''! I hope this one beats the pants off all those vicious looking animals.', '2009-06-13 02:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526161, 797480, 76430, '<td valign="top">Are you short of zoos in your area?  Nice shot of the woman and horse.  I would have cropped out the tail end of the other horse.</td>', 'Are you short of zoos in your area?  Nice shot of the woman and horse.  I would have cropped out the tail end of the other horse.', '2009-06-13 03:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526167, 796506, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot nicely titled.  It looks like a stuffed lacquer covered turtle, reducing the realism but making a nice shiny image.  I love the San Diego Zoo and Wild Animal Park.  We''ve been members there for many years.</td>', 'Very creative shot nicely titled.  It looks like a stuffed lacquer covered turtle, reducing the realism but making a nice shiny image.  I love the San Diego Zoo and Wild Animal Park.  We''ve been members there for many years.', '2009-06-13 03:32:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5526168, 797435, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and excellent border as well as camel hair on the lettering.</td>', 'Nice shot and excellent border as well as camel hair on the lettering.', '2009-06-13 03:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526169, 796713, 76430, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Is this real or a stuffed cheetah with a painted background?  I wish I knew before voting.  If it''s live it''s excellent setup and lighting.  If a museum someone else did a great job.  I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt.  In any case it''s nicely done.</td>', 'Cute title.  Is this real or a stuffed cheetah with a painted background?  I wish I knew before voting.  If it''s live it''s excellent setup and lighting.  If a museum someone else did a great job.  I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt.  In any case it''s nicely done.', '2009-06-13 03:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526170, 796937, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  Those windows are hard to shoot through without reflection.</td>', 'Great macro.  Those windows are hard to shoot through without reflection.', '2009-06-13 03:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526174, 796464, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on the lion and bokeh in the background almost making the fence disappear.  I''m wondering if blurring the remaining crosshatch would be better. Good composition allows for excellent placement of the text.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on the lion and bokeh in the background almost making the fence disappear.  I''m wondering if blurring the remaining crosshatch would be better. Good composition allows for excellent placement of the text.', '2009-06-13 03:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526175, 796809, 76430, '<td valign="top">Humming bird. San Diego.  I''m guessing Ann?  Good capture.  I''ve never seen a humming bird feeding its young.  Good sharp focus and BG bokeh.  The colors look more pastel than I would expect.</td>', 'Humming bird. San Diego.  I''m guessing Ann?  Good capture.  I''ve never seen a humming bird feeding its young.  Good sharp focus and BG bokeh.  The colors look more pastel than I would expect.', '2009-06-13 03:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526176, 795947, 76430, '<td valign="top">Lots of San Diego Zoo entries, but it is about the best zoo there is.  I''m going to have to see the new exhibit.  Nice capture of the elephant in action surrounded by dust.</td>', 'Lots of San Diego Zoo entries, but it is about the best zoo there is.  I''m going to have to see the new exhibit.  Nice capture of the elephant in action surrounded by dust.', '2009-06-13 03:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526178, 796739, 76430, '<td valign="top">This looks way over-sharpened, but as wrinkled as elephants get maybe it is fairly realistic since I don''t see the sharpening halos.  It''s nicely composed and edited.</td>', 'This looks way over-sharpened, but as wrinkled as elephants get maybe it is fairly realistic since I don''t see the sharpening halos.  It''s nicely composed and edited.', '2009-06-13 03:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526179, 797448, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hi <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68887" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">shoggy</a>.  You might want to take some information off your EXIF data.  Nice close-up and getting the catch lights.  The background looks a bit noisy.</td>', 'Hi  shoggy.  You might want to take some information off your EXIF data.  Nice close-up and getting the catch lights.  The background looks a bit noisy.', '2009-06-13 03:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526180, 797236, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice pose.  I wish you could have gotten rid of the reflection.  Maybe a CPF would help.</td>', 'Nice pose.  I wish you could have gotten rid of the reflection.  Maybe a CPF would help.', '2009-06-13 03:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526181, 797444, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the otter, beaver or whatever it is.  Waiting until you caught it looking at you may have been better.  The background looks pretty noisy.  If I read your EXIF right it''s because you are shooting at ISO 3200.  I would recommend bumping that WAY down and dropping from 1/800 shutter speed to compensate.</td>', 'Nice shot of the otter, beaver or whatever it is.  Waiting until you caught it looking at you may have been better.  The background looks pretty noisy.  If I read your EXIF right it''s because you are shooting at ISO 3200.  I would recommend bumping that WAY down and dropping from 1/800 shutter speed to compensate.', '2009-06-13 03:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526263, 797481, 25355, '<td valign="top">I went to a butterfly house to try to get a good shot, but I didn''t get anything that could compete against the big cats and raptors. However, you have got a real beauty.</td>', 'I went to a butterfly house to try to get a good shot, but I didn''t get anything that could compete against the big cats and raptors. However, you have got a real beauty.', '2009-06-13 07:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526267, 796809, 25355, '<td valign="top">There are 330 species of hummingbird, but only 16 species breed north of Mexico.</td>', 'There are 330 species of hummingbird, but only 16 species breed north of Mexico.', '2009-06-13 07:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526269, 797512, 25355, '<td valign="top">Emus don''t squawk! They sort of boom.</td>', 'Emus don''t squawk! They sort of boom.', '2009-06-13 07:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526290, 797510, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the abstract approach and the simple colors - this is really really good</td>', 'i love the abstract approach and the simple colors - this is really really good', '2009-06-13 08:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5526292, 795772, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the slogan and the composition but the colors just seem a bit oversaturated on the skin -7</td>', 'i love the slogan and the composition but the colors just seem a bit oversaturated on the skin -7', '2009-06-13 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
