(5528524, 797512, 53814, '<td valign="top">This is a photo that doesn''t need the words, it would be better without them. Anyone who has spent any quality time with an emu would appreciate this comical, absurd concept. The slight blur makes it look as though the emu is moving it''s head back and forth trying to decide which work of art is the best.(Personally, I prefer the painting on the right). Excellent.</td>', 'This is a photo that doesn''t need the words, it would be better without them. Anyone who has spent any quality time with an emu would appreciate this comical, absurd concept. The slight blur makes it look as though the emu is moving it''s head back and forth trying to decide which work of art is the best.(Personally, I prefer the painting on the right). Excellent.', '2009-06-15 02:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
