(5528587, 796713, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, you can retire now.  :-)  I''m betting the zoo would love to have a copy of this - it would make an awesome poster.  And I''m still trying to figure out how they keep the cheetah in the zoo... looks like he could just head for the hills any time he wanted to.  This says alot for both your photograph and the way the zoo has the exhibit set up.  ''Grats all around!</td>', 'OK, you can retire now.  :-)  I''m betting the zoo would love to have a copy of this - it would make an awesome poster.  And I''m still trying to figure out how they keep the cheetah in the zoo... looks like he could just head for the hills any time he wanted to.  This says alot for both your photograph and the way the zoo has the exhibit set up.  ''Grats all around!', '2009-06-15 03:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
