(5530701, 796713, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see this was real.  Though I doubted I gave you an 8.  I know cheetah''s do OK with people, but they are fast and you can''t see any barrier in this shot.  Was this a hill in the middle of a fenced off area?  Congratulations on a well done shot and a well deserved ribbon!  I can''t believe how perfectly everything worked.  The perfection was the main reason for my doubt.</td>', 'I''m glad to see this was real.  Though I doubted I gave you an 8.  I know cheetah''s do OK with people, but they are fast and you can''t see any barrier in this shot.  Was this a hill in the middle of a fenced off area?  Congratulations on a well done shot and a well deserved ribbon!  I can''t believe how perfectly everything worked.  The perfection was the main reason for my doubt.', '2009-06-16 00:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
