(5530752, 797349, 86447, '<td valign="top">I had this sheep pegged as a SandyP image.  That''s a compliment since she''s good with animals.  Well, and with people, too.  :)<br/> <br/>What I''m trying to say, in my bumbling way, is:<br/> <br/>I like this, Irene.<br/> <br/>It''s very well done.  Friendly and sharp.  :)<br/> <br/>And I love his smile and the twinkle in his eye.  He appears to have a secret.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-15 23:57:13.</i></td>', 'I had this sheep pegged as a SandyP image.  That''s a compliment since she''s good with animals.  Well, and with people, too.  :) What I''m trying to say, in my bumbling way, is: I like this, Irene. It''s very well done.  Friendly and sharp.  :) And I love his smile and the twinkle in his eye.  He appears to have a secret.', '2009-06-16 00:56:33.000000', '2009-06-16 00:57:13.000000', 0),
